  "summary": "不思議なタイトルから。。。 こんにちは 小坂菜緒です 4月20日(土)にグランメッセ熊本で開催されました TGC KUMAMOTO 2019 by TOKYO GIRLS COLLECTION にモデルとして出演させて頂きました！ 今回は2...",
  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">不思議なタイトルから。。。</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">4</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">20</span><span class=\"s2\">日(土)にグランメッセ熊本で開催されました</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">TGC KUMAMOTO 2019 by TOKYO GIRLS COLLECTION</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">にモデルとして出演させて頂きました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">今回は</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">ステージ歩かせていただきました！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">まずは</span><span class=\"s1\">REDYAZEL</span><span class=\"s2\">さんのステージです！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">衣装の写真を撮り忘れてしまって(</span><span class=\"s1\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">黒のノースリーブのワンピースを着ました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">とっても可愛くて、欲しくなっちゃいました</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s3\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そして、このステージで初めてラストを歩かせていただきました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">本当に本当に緊張しましたが、同じステージだった乃木坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">さんの白石麻衣さんが声をかけてくださって、頑張ってよかったと思いました((</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s4\">॑</span><span class=\"s5\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s4\">॑</span><span class=\"s1\">*&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">))</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">白石麻衣さんが「キュン」のお話をしてくださって、本当にすごく嬉しかったです</span><span class=\"s3\">😶💕</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">もっと頑張ります！！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また</span><span class=\"s1\">REDYAZEL</span><span class=\"s2\">さんのステージ歩かせていただけるよう頑張ります！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">そして、</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">ステージ目は</span><span class=\"s1\">LAGUNA GEM</span><span class=\"s2\">さんのステージです！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">TGC</span><span class=\"s2\">で歩かせて頂くのは</span><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\">回目で、また</span><span class=\"s1\">LAGUNA GEM</span><span class=\"s2\">さんで歩くことが出来て本当に嬉しかったです！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-04-28/28814_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5437.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">オールバックしちゃいました(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ミニ丈のワンピースです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">とってもクールでオシャレですよね</span><span class=\"s3\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">カッコよく歩くステージは、もっともっと研究して頑張ります！！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また</span><span class=\"s1\">LAGUNA GEM</span><span class=\"s2\">さんのステージを歩かせていただけるように頑張ります！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> *&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ファッションショー続きでお知らせです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">5/18</span><span class=\"s2\">(土)に開催される「</span><span class=\"s1\">Rakuten GirlsAward 2019 SPRING/SUMMER</span><span class=\"s2\">」にモデルとして出演させていただきます！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">そして、日向坂</span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">のアーティスト</span><span class=\"s1\">LIVE</span><span class=\"s2\">で出演することも決定しました！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">私は「</span><span class=\"s1\">seventeen SPECIAL STAGE</span><span class=\"s2\">」にも出演しますのでお楽しみにしていてください♪♪♪</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今からすごく楽しみになってきました！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">是非、遊びに来てください！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-04-28/28814_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5658.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">4/29</span><span class=\"s2\">に幕張メッセで「黒い羊」個別握手会</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">4/30</span><span class=\"s2\">に幕張メッセで「キュン」全国握手会</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">があります！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">日間続けてとなりますが、会いに来てくれますか？？？</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">全国握手会は第</span><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\">レーンです！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">キュンの全国握手会でもソロレーンでやらせていただきます(</span><span class=\"s1\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"s2\">)(</span><span class=\"s1\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"s2\">)(</span><span class=\"s1\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">不安でしかないんですけど</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">少しでも興味を持ってくださったら、是非会いに来てください！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">お話に関しましてはちょっと力が足りない部分もありますが、良い握手会にできるように頑張りますので、楽しみましょう</span><span class=\"s3\">✨✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">たくさんの方々が来て下さるのをお待ちしております！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ミニライブもありますので、そちらもぜひ</span><span class=\"s3\">😶💕</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-04-28/28814_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4938.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">待ってんで</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">読んでいただきありがとうございます</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">小坂菜緒</span><span class=\"s1\">^._.^</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">#111</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">泣きたい事があった、そんな日があった。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">けれどその日は泣けなかった。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">何故だろうと考えたら、その日は「日向坂で会いましょう」の放送日でした。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ふとテレビをつけたら、ちょうど「日向坂で会いましょう」がやっていて、自然と笑顔に</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なんかメンバーじゃなくて、いちファンとして、視聴者として見ている感覚になりました</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">収録に参加している自分も、本当にいつも楽しくってオードリーさんとメンバーの掛け合いが大好きで、早く次の収録がしたいんです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">オードリーさんのお二人の愛が感じられる場面も所々あって、個人的には面白くなっちゃって（笑）</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">「日向坂で会いましょう」見てくださいね。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">笑ったら教えてください。絶対にですよ(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p></div>\n                    ",
